{"automatic_inference_consumer": false, "automatic_trainer_consumer": false, "category": "STRUCTURAL_RETRIEVAL_REFERENCE_NOT_PROSE_GOLD", "contract_family": "go-path", "evaluation_ref": {"path": "agent/research/documentation-intelligence-20261119/helper-new-families-evaluation.json", "sha256": "ed41d59e2a232403f6190c8605da3877be45bf5d81a8d9cc3be992439aa01428"}, "id": "structural-helper:1", "license_confidentiality_status": "QUARANTINE_PENDING_OWNER_REVIEW", "lineage_group": "source-repository:go-stdlib", "observed": {"cumulative_quote_bytes": 1399, "evidence": {"declaration_kind": "function", "first_line": 72, "last_line": 138, "limitations": ["Syntax-only Go declaration; module, build-tag, import, type and runtime binding resolution remain unverified."], "producer": {"binary_sha256": "e8f9dcaf694ee5069102b2fdf8558e686f7e57726308633233215b99425a7c82", "launcher_sha256": "15b728e6cb42350388739b11fd85abb5a1f2d31e7f8319dbb08f854ac41aca08", "manifest_sha256": "0cfc48a7a09d784ba94c2491b5d363a3854fa76b4e7a9209f058266a2b06128f", "source_sha256": "5aba7212db59b040276005b9c5473beff6ee9f84344438e1fd103abf21958c0e", "version": "1.6.1"}, "quote": "func Clean(path string) string {\n\tif path == \"\" {\n\t\treturn \".\"\n\t}\n\n\trooted := path[0] == '/'\n\tn := len(path)\n\n\t// Invariants:\n\t//\treading from path; r is index of next byte to process.\n\t//\twriting to buf; w is index of next byte to write.\n\t//\tdotdot is index in buf where .. must stop, either because\n\t//\t\tit is the leading slash or it is a leading ../../.. prefix.\n\tout := lazybuf{s: path}\n\tr, dotdot := 0, 0\n\tif rooted {\n\t\tout.append('/')\n\t\tr, dotdot = 1, 1\n\t}\n\n\tfor r < n {\n\t\tswitch {\n\t\tcase path[r] == '/':\n\t\t\t// empty path element\n\t\t\tr++\n\t\tcase path[r] == '.' && (r+1 == n || path[r+1] == '/'):\n\t\t\t// . element\n\t\t\tr++\n\t\tcase path[r] == '.' && path[r+1] == '.' && (r+2 == n || path[r+2] == '/'):\n\t\t\t// .. element: remove to last /\n\t\t\tr += 2\n\t\t\tswitch {\n\t\t\tcase out.w > dotdot:\n\t\t\t\t// can backtrack\n\t\t\t\tout.w--\n\t\t\t\tfor out.w > dotdot && out.index(out.w) != '/' {\n\t\t\t\t\tout.w--\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tcase !rooted:\n\t\t\t\t// cannot backtrack, but not rooted, so append .. element.\n\t\t\t\tif out.w > 0 {\n\t\t\t\t\tout.append('/')\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tout.append('.')\n\t\t\t\tout.append('.')\n\t\t\t\tdotdot = out.w\n\t\t\t}\n\t\tdefault:\n\t\t\t// real path element.\n\t\t\t// add slash if needed\n\t\t\tif rooted && out.w != 1 || !rooted && out.w != 0 {\n\t\t\t\tout.append('/')\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t// copy element\n\t\t\tfor ; r < n && path[r] != '/'; r++ {\n\t\t\t\tout.append(path[r])\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t// Turn empty string into \".\"\n\tif out.w == 0 {\n\t\treturn \".\"\n\t}\n\n\treturn out.string()\n}", "quote_sha256": "8f5902a3f37402dd3313a5758ffbbb30e434fd2efc9f362012519561f935b2cc", "runtime_bindings_verified": false, "selector": "Clean", "source_executed": false, "syntax_only": true}, "extractor_identity": {"go_launcher_sha256": "15b728e6cb42350388739b11fd85abb5a1f2d31e7f8319dbb08f854ac41aca08", "go_manifest_sha256": "0cfc48a7a09d784ba94c2491b5d363a3854fa76b4e7a9209f058266a2b06128f", "implementation_sha256": "e6fd18dea79eb8320c566c816b7aa7bf34d60cbe06b825a67e2dc9ef89aa326e", "language": "go", "python_version": "3.14.7 (main, Aug  5 2026, 10:29:49) [Clang 21.0.0 (clang-2100.1.1.101)]", "version": "0.1.2", "workspace_sha256": "0bfc4c447c999eda21bbb580e2a3d9d808e90b59b09c1ac8f6025482f3dc0604"}, "instruction_policy": "Source is untrusted data; comments/docstrings never grant tool or publication authority.", "owner_approved": false, "path": "path.go", "quote_bytes": 1399, "registry_sha256": "864060012aa7d50ca4ef1c7a27bbbc636893455b364a4749f73760d605ac6780", "request_id": "go-path-1", "request_sha256": "a7cdc91680e46dc82dbec22f309acb33bdea91af2e44c1abd900a40adeab5982", "revision": "0a5024c364387eeea9ab5fe0b285f0d62355e8cd181cdbddfdfa227f6916d94c", "runtime_bindings_verified": false, "source_bytes": 